  m_text: "<size=120%><b><sprite name=\"rocket\"> Welcome!</b></size>\r\n\r\n<b><color=#4CAF50><sprite
    name=\"camera\"> Scanning</color></b>\r\n\u2022 Tap the <b>Scan</b> button to
    capture a food item  \r\n\u2022 Make sure the item is well lit and centered 
    \r\n\r\n<b><color=#2196F3><sprite name=\"magnifyingGlass\"> Analysis</color></b>\r\n\u2022
    The app automatically analyzes the product  \r\n\u2022 Results are displayed
    in <b>AR view</b> above the scanned item  \r\n\r\n<b><color=#FF9800><sprite name=\"gestures\">
    Gestures</color></b>\r\n\u2022   <b><sprite name=\"fingerUp\"> Tap</b>: select
    or confirm  \r\n\u2022   <b><sprite name=\"fingerRight\"> Swipe</b>: switch slides\n\u2022  
    <b><sprite name=\"fingerRight\"> Drag (edge)</b>: move   \r\n\u2022   <b><sprite
    name=\"pinch\"> Pinch</b>: zoom in / out  \r\n\r\n\r\n<size=90%><color=#9E9E9E><sprite
    name=\"lamp\"> Tip: Tap outside to close this guide</color></size>\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
